# Control-channel script for this app's sim row (sim-run.sh::run_test, sim
# rows only). `wait <regex>` blocks until the log matches; every other line
# goes to the simulator's control channel as typed, the verbs `pdb input`
# takes on hardware. Left and right reach the content's OnSwipeListener; the
# pull-down is the SwipeRefreshLayout's (a refresh, not "swipe down"); up is
# the listener's again.
wait SwipeDemo[]:] Display ready
input swipe 220 100 40 100 150
wait SwipeDemo[]:] swipe left
input swipe 40 100 220 100 150
wait SwipeDemo[]:] swipe right
input swipe 120 40 120 200 150
wait SwipeDemo[]:] refresh 1
input swipe 120 200 120 40 150
